Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, Ross, she wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的啦，罗斯 她要你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:07.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She barely knows me. We just live in the same building.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:07.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她一点也不认识我 只是刚好是邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Any contact? - She lent me an egg once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有来往吗？ - 有次借我颗鸡蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:11.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:11.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就算数了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, Ross. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Ross. You gotta get back in the game here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样 你该回到情场来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:29.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Rachel thing's not happening, your ex-wife's a lesbian, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:29.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟瑞秋的恋情不成 前妻爱女人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:32.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think we need a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:32.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用我再说第三位了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. Could we get an egg over here, still in the shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打扰了，可以给颗全蛋吗 有壳的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:36.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:36.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蛋？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Go up to her and say, "Here's your egg back. I'm returning your egg."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:42.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，你就上前跟她说 蛋还你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:44.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:44.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样很有魅力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I think it's insane. - She'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 明明就很瞎 - 她会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:51.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Thank you. - Thank you. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:51.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谢谢 - 谢谢，拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:56.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go with the egg, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:56.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带着蛋去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY & CHANDLER: Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:06.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Think it'll work? - It's suicide. The man's got an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:06.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你想会成功吗？ - 是自杀，他携有鸡蛋
