Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:38.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:42.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: You cannot do this. RACHEL: What? Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不可以这样 - 怎样？不可以怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Roger wants to take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗杰明晚要约她出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:04.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Pheebs. Don't you remember why you dumped the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:04.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，不行，你难道忘了 当初为什么甩掉他的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because he was creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他让人毛骨耸然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And mean. And a little frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刻薄 又让人有点害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:12.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still, it's nice to have a date on Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:12.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但情人节有人约 总比没的好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 大家好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:14.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can go out with a creep any night of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，想约毛骨耸然男 随时都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少我就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:20.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：比尔·劳伦斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:21.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:21.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing tomorrow night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明晚你们有什么打算？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, tomorrow night depends on how tonight goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那要看今晚的发展
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:31.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh. Uh, listen, about tonight... - No, no, don't you dare bail on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:31.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 今晚呢 - 不行，不准反悔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:33.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：詹姆斯·柏洛斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's only going out with me because I'm bringing a friend for her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她答应跟我约会，就是因为 我答应帮她朋友找伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:37.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But her friend sounds like such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:37.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她朋友听来似乎是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pathetic mess. I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可悲惨又很糟 这我知道，但…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, man, she's needy, she's vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样啦，老兄，她很渴望 很脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm thinking:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:55.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You haven't been out with a woman since Janice. You're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:55.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟珍妮丝分手后就没约会过 今晚你一定要去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:02:59.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She said yes. - Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:02:59.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她答应了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes! Way to go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了，老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: Still got the egg, huh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 蛋你没还人家？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:21.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How do I look? - Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:21.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我样子如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洛莲来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, remember, no trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记住喔 不能跟我换
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:32.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get the pretty one. I get the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:32.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}漂亮的给你 悲惨的给我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi, Joey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 乔伊 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look what you brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看这是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:42.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:42.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what did you bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看你带了谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's checking her coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还在寄放外套
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:52.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, I'm gonna go wash the cab smell off of my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:52.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，我去洗手 把计程车味道洗掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:56.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you get me a white zinfandel and a glass of red for Janice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:56.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我叫白葡萄酒 帮珍妮丝叫杯红葡萄酒好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:04.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Janice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:04.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}珍妮丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:08.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:08.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, it's Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是珍妮丝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:25.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm making a break for it. I'm going out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:25.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要逃走了 从窗户出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't, please. I've been waiting for forever to go out with Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别走啦，拜托 我想约洛莲好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Just calm down. - Calm down? Calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 冷静点 - 冷静？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You set me up with a woman I've dumped twice in the last five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个五个月内被我甩过两次的女人 你硬把我们凑成对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:42.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you stop yelling? You're making me nervous...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:42.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别对我吼好吗 这让我好紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:47.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I can't go when I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:47.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一紧张就尿不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I'm sorry. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，你说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:57.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on! Do it, do it, do it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:57.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点，快尿 快尿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:03.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Roger was creepy, but he was nothing compared to Pete Carney.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:03.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦，罗杰是很怪 但跟皮特卡尼比起来不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Which one was he? - Pete the Weeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 皮特·卡尼谁？ - 爱哭鬼皮特？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember the guy that used to cry every time we had sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每次做爱都会哭的家伙 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:12.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Oh, was it good for you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:12.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝你也舒服吗？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:18.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'd take a little crying any day over Howard, the "I win" guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:18.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小哭一下何妨 总比不服输霍华〝强〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I win. I win."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我赢了，我赢了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I went out with him for two months. I didn't get to win once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他约会两个月 都没赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do we end up with these jerks? We're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们人这么好 怎会找到这些混蛋呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I think we're like some kind of magnets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道，可能是因为 我们拥有特别磁力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I am. That's why I can't wear a digital watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确定我有 所以我才不能戴数位手表
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's more beer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你那瓶酒比较多，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:47.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. You know my friend Abby who shaves her head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:47.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得我那个 把头理光的朋友艾比吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She says to break the bad-boyfriend cycle...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说如果想破除 恶男交友魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you can do a cleansing ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以进行净身仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, this woman is voluntarily bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，这女人 志愿变秃耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:02.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:02.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:05.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we can do it tomorrow night, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:05.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就选明晚来做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Valentine's Day. It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情人节 很适合
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, what kind of ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎样的仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:14.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we can, um, burn the stuff they gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:14.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是把他们送的东西烧掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者…？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:22.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or we can chant and dance around naked, you know, with sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者可以脱光了又唱又跳 拿根木棍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:26.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Burning's good. - Burning's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:26.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 烧束西比较好 - 烧东西比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: I've got stuff to burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有可以烧的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:43.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...ever since I was little, I've been able to pick up quarters with my toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:43.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打从我小时候 我就有办法用脚趾捡硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah? Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？好了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:52.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, quarters or rolls of quarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:52.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几枚硬币 还是整捆硬币？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:01.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, Chandler, I cut you out of all of my pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:01.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}顺道一提，钱德 照片上有你的都被我剪了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if you want, I have a bag with just your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想要的话 有一整袋子都是你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:12.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure? Because you could make little puppets out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:12.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？因为可以拿来 作成小玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:16.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you could use them in your Theater of Cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:16.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后放在残酷剧场演戏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:24.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? What can't you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:24.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啥？不能怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:29.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, can I talk to you for a second? Over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:29.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以私下一聊？ 到那边？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:38.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, we might be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:38.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们想走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me it's you and me "we."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说我跟你的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:47.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She said she wants to slather my body with stuff and then lick it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:47.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说想在我全身涂抹东西 再舔掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:49.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not even sure what slathering is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:49.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我连涂抹是什么意思都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I definitely want to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我很想试试
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:57.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you cannot do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不可以这样对我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. I'm sorry. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，抱歉 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:05.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, can we have three chocolate mousses to go, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:05.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻烦三个巧克力慕丝外带
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's my credit card. Dinner's on me. I'm sorry, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}信用卡给你 晚餐我请，抱歉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope she throws up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望她吐在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:19.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:24.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So... - Just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:24.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那么 - 剩我们俩了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh, what a crappy night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好烂的一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Although I have enjoyed the fact that your shirt's been sticking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我还满高兴从你上完厕所后 你的衬衫就从…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:34.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of your zipper since you came back from the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:34.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}裤子拉链跑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:45.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:45.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:54.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So do we have the best friends, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:54.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们这算是误交损友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey's not a friend. He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊算不上朋友 他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:02.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a stupid man who left us his credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:02.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把信用卡留给我们用的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:07.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another drink? Some dessert? A big-screen TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:07.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再来一杯？点心？ 大屏幕电视机？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will go for that drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就再来一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:10.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got it. Good woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:10.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题，小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A bottle of your most overpriced champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最贵的香槟 来一瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Each. - That's right. Each.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 每人一瓶 - 没错，每人一瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. And a, uh, Rob Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一瓶罗伯洛伊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've always wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直很好奇那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:47.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Happy Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:47.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情人节快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I miss you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经开始想你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you believe this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能相信会这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And yet it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但却真的发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Goodbye, Janice. - Kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 再见了，珍妮丝 - 亲一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Chandler. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Chandler. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，抱歉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:21.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, Janice. - Hi, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:21.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 珍妮丝 - 摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:24.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, this was very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:24.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真的很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:28.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, come see who's out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:28.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，快来看 外头是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's going on...? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么…？ 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:34.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Janice. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:34.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}珍妮丝，你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Janice is gonna go away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}珍妮丝正要走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去去就回
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:44.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Joey. Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:44.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，看谁来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good. Joey's home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好耶，乔伊回家了
